00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:51.150
September 1868
Takaku Village, Aizu

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.420
Truth

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:07.260
Truth

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:14.040
Truth

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:41.900
I stare into your face

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:47.940
Illuminated by the dark red setting sun

00:21:47.940 --> 00:22:00.050
I softly wish upon the burning sky to stop time

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:11.500
You earnestly try to move forward
as you bear your sadness

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:24.580
If possible, I want to follow
you down this rugged path

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:31.490
The clouds flow by in the far, far distance

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:36.860
Even if this moment lasts but a moment

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:39.960
I want to be with you

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:50.740
The sun that dyes my heart will last forever

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:57.270
So just believe in our bonds

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:15.200
Next time
